# UCI HAR Dataset is large, but kept for API evaluation
# Uncomment if you want to exclude it
# **/UCI_HAR_Dataset/train/Inertial Signals/*.txt
# **/UCI_HAR_Dataset/test/Inertial Signals/*.txt

